Description: Study and data utilities for the Cardiovascular Outcomes,
  Registries and Research (CORR) group of the Heart, Vascular and Thoracic
  Institute (HVTI) at the Cleveland Clinic. The package sets up a standard
  study directory layout and resolves paths within it; reads clinical data
  and converts variable types; manages variable and value labels; registers
  datasets in a study data contract and records manifests, file hashes and
  provenance; caches expensive model fits; defines the analysis taxonomy that
  names jobs and their files; ports common 'SAS' procedures such as
  'PROC MEANS' and 'PROC FREQ' to R; and compares R results with 'SAS'
  reference output.
